    "body": "Had to look up what [`<fieldset>`](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/fieldset) did since I haven't used it in a while. From my research, a fieldset holds a [group of controls](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#writing-a-form%27s-user-interface). Would this issue be as simple as replacing \"form control\" with \"fieldset\"?",
