    "body": "No, these sentences are extracted from the `<h3 class=\"no-num\">Attributes</h3>` section by the build script. So either we'd have to define these attributes separately for fieldset or we'd have to modify the build script somehow so it doesn't apply this logic to fieldset so we can put custom sentences there.",
