    "body": "The `output` and `fieldset` elements each have their own line with `<!-- variant -->`. I assume this is used to change the output at build time?\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<h4>The <dfn><code>fieldset</code></dfn> element</h4>\r\n\r\n<dl class=\"element\">\r\n ...\r\n <dd><code data-x=\"attr-fieldset-disabled\">disabled</code></dd>\r\n <dd><code data-x=\"attr-fae-form\">form</code></dd>\r\n <dd><code data-x=\"attr-fe-name\">name</code> <!-- variant --> </dd>\r\n ...\r\n</dl>\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhat is the best way to resolve this issue? Would like to avoid code duplication if possible.",
