    "body": "Hmm yeah, I guess that operates on the `or:` thing below\r\n```\r\n<td> Name of form control to use for <span>form submission</span> and in the <code data-x=\"dom-form-elements\">form.elements</code> API <!--or: Name of form control to use in the <code data-x=\"dom-form-elements\">form.elements</code> API -->\r\n````\r\nin combination with https://github.com/whatwg/html-build/blob/master/.pre-process-annotate-attributes.pl.\r\n\r\nHowever, it seems this would still require more changes as we'd need three variants for name...",
