    "updated_at": "2018-03-02T16:46:51Z",
    "body": "If this is the way to go, how about updating the code base so `<!-- variant:fieldset -->` specifies a specific `or:` like `<!--or(fieldset): ... -->`?\r\n\r\nIf there's a better way, I'm open to suggestions. There are only two occurrences of `<!-- variant -->`, so I think that any significant change should be done now before more of these are added.",
